om/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/twist-bioscience-corporation-twst-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"TWST 2019 Q3","e":"twst","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Emily Leproust","x":"The cost saving that we bring may not cover the entire cost of revalidating under the new switching product.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/twist-bioscience-corporation-twst-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"TWST 2019 Q3","e":"twst","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Emily Leproust","x":"In that case, the Fast Hyb is a fantastic door opener because at that point, we not only bring cost saving, but we bring a workflow advantage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/twist-bioscience-corporation-twst-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"TWST 2019 Q4","e":"twst","d":"2019-12-11","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Emily M. Leproust","x":"We will also pursue additional applications of our technology within the SNP microarray market, including the DTC and high-bio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/11/twist-bioscience-corp-twst-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"TWST 2020 Q4","e":"twst","d":"2020-11-23","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Puneet Souda","x":"I mean, I appreciate this is a significant lumpiness in the quarter, but just trying to understand, given the seasonal nature of it, and I assume this is a DTC and not a tissue or liquid customer, that they should come in next year, but correct me if I'm wrong on that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/23/twist-bioscience-corp-twst-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"TWST 2021 Q1","e":"twst","d":"2021-02-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jim Thorburn","x":"We also see significant revenue coming from customers who convert from SNP microarray to using this Twist for genotype, either for direct-to-consumer or population genetic purposes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021